<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;c&gt;use&lt;/c&gt; is evaluated at compile time; try &lt;c&gt;eval STRING&lt;/c&gt; instead of &lt;c&gt;eval BLOCK&lt;/c&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;code&gt;
BEGIN {
  # ...
  eval q{use $v};
  die $@ if $@;
}
&lt;/code&gt;</doctext>
